"document viewer Okular became the first ever Blue Angel eco-certified "
"computer program! Blue Angel is the German version of the U.S. Energy Star "
"label.</p>\n"
"    <a href=\"https://eco.kde.org/blog/2022-03-16-press-release-okular-blue-"
"angel/\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg mx-auto\" alt=\"\">Learn more</"
